  "remarks": "LLC SYSTEM INDUSTRIAL GROUP specialises in wholesale trade and commission trade. It acts as a supplier to JSC IEMZ Kupol. It specifically supplies materials and components used to transport the warheads of the Garpiya one-way attack UAVs. These UAVs are used by the Russian Armed Forces during Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine.",
